# RETIRED REFERENCE ONLY
#
# Feature 004 does not use a rendered cloudflared configuration, named tunnel,
# credential file, public hostname, or DNS route. Start the approved test path
# from deploy/cloudflared/quick-tunnel.md:
#
#   cloudflared tunnel --url http://127.0.0.1:8080 --loglevel info
#
# The former feature-003 named-tunnel example is intentionally not executable
# so it cannot accidentally expose an unauthorized hostname or stale origin.
